@startuml public_blog_feed_flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Inter, Segoe UI, sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowout false

skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    BorderColor #64748B
    FontColor #0F172A
    FontSize 11
    ArrowColor #475569
    ArrowFontSize 10
}

skinparam activityDiamond {
    BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
    BorderColor #D97706
    FontColor #92400E
}

title **Modern Laravel Blog - Public Feed & Multi-Parameter Query Filtering Flow**

|#EFF6FF|Visitor (Client Browser)|
|#F0FDF4|PostController|
|#FEFCE8|Post Model (Eloquent / Local Scopes)|
|#FAF5FF|SQLite Database & Blade Components|

|Visitor (Client Browser)|
start
:Visitor requests public blog feed:\n**GET /** with optional query parameters\n(""search"", ""category"", ""author"", ""page"");

|PostController|
:Invoke **PostController@index(Request $request)**;
:Extract query filters:\n""$request->only(['search', 'category', 'author'])"";

|Post Model (Eloquent / Local Scopes)|
:Initialize query: **Post::latest()**;
:Apply local scope: **->filter($filters)**;

if ($filters['search'] provided?) then (yes)
    :Apply SQL search clause:\n""WHERE (title LIKE ? OR body LIKE ?)"";
endif

if ($filters['category'] provided?) then (yes)
    :Apply category relation filter:\n""whereHas('category', fn($q) => $q->where('slug', $category))"";
endif

if ($filters['author'] provided?) then (yes)
    :Apply author relation filter:\n""whereHas('author', fn($q) => $q->where('username', $author))"";
endif

:Eager load relationships in **$with** property:\n- **author** (User model)\n- **category** (Category model)\n*(Prevents N+1 queries via AppServiceProvider)*;

:Apply pagination with query string retention:\n**->paginate(9)->withQueryString()**;

|SQLite Database & Blade Components|
:Execute paginated SELECT query on SQLite database;
:Fetch category listing with post counts:\n""Category::withCount('posts')->orderBy('name')->get()"";

|PostController|
:Pass data to view **posts.index**:\n(posts, categories, currentCategory, currentAuthor);

|SQLite Database & Blade Components|
:Compile Blade Component tree:
- **<x-public-layout>** (HTML shell, Tailwind, Alpine.js)
  - **<x-navbar>** (Active navigation, search, mobile drawer)
  - **<x-search-bar>** (Search input & active filter pills);

if (Posts Collection Empty?) then (yes - No Results)
    :Render Empty State component with "Clear filters" action;
else (no - Posts Found)
    :Loop through 9 paginated posts;
    :Render **<x-post-card :post="$post">**:
    - Featured image (or curated dynamic gradient)
    - **<x-badge>** with dynamic category color
    - Title & excerpt snippet
    - Author avatar & name linking to author filter
    - Relative publish date via **diffForHumans()**;
    :Render responsive pagination links;
endif

|Visitor (Client Browser)|
:Display responsive blog feed with interactive filter pills; <<#DCFCE7>>
stop

@enduml
